            <p class="CiteTOC"><a rel="cgi/extract.pl?page=html/BurlingtonCH/BurlingtonCH02.html&amp;anchor=26" href="/VT/Burlington/#!/BurlingtonCH/BurlingtonCH02.html#26" class="basic">26&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Questions at special meetings to be decided by ballot.</a></p>

            <p class="ArticleTOC">Article 10. Mayor to Preside</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a rel="cgi/extract.pl?page=html/BurlingtonCH/BurlingtonCH02.html&amp;anchor=27" href="/VT/Burlington/#!/BurlingtonCH/BurlingtonCH02.html#27" class="basic">27&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Presiding officer; powers.</a></p>

